  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the binchotan-grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Season the beef with black pepper and smoked paprika.",
    "Sear the beef in the binchotan-grill for 2-3 minutes per side, or until browned.",
    "Transfer the beef to a Dutch oven or heavy pot.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, and carrots to the pot and cook until the vegetables are softened.",
    "Add the beef broth, nuka-pickle juice, dark brown soft sugar, Dijon mustard, and apple cider vinegar to the pot.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then cover the pot and transfer it to the binchotan-grill for 2 1/2 hours.",
    "Remove the pot from the grill and let it rest for 10 minutes.",
    "Slice the beef against the grain and serve with the braising liquid.",
    "Serve with additional carrots and onions, if desired."
  ],
